{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. With each wave, survey further into the unknown to track down the source of the rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survey the Unknown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/exploration.gif?t=1746958507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each wave, survey the unknown to expand the map. Different towers can benefit from different geography, so choose carefully Commander!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/reward_selection_smaller.gif?t=1746958507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from randomized upgrade rewards after every wave that strengthen your towers and can even grant new effects. Discover different combinations and strategies every expedition!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unearth Ancient Artifacts</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/artifacts_1.gif?t=1746958507\" /><br>Unearth powerful artifacts that grant unique effects to supercharge your defenses. Try to discover them all!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Commander Selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/commander_choice.gif?t=1746958507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from different commanders, each offering unique starting strategies and abilities to tailor your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/extras/endless.gif?t=1746958507\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive 30 challenging waves and enter endless mode, testing the limits of your defenses! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686580?t=1746958507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686580?t=1746958507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/4f4fc9c1e6db9c9a89cc4c9e721997df24553785/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746958507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686580/4f4fc9c1e6db9c9a89cc4c9e721997df24553785/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746958507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Repel the Rifts</strong> is a roguelite tower defense game set on an alien world. As a Commander of a mining expedition gone awry, you must defend against relentless waves of inter-dimensional creatures emerging from mysterious rifts. With each wave, survey further into the unknown to track down the source of the rifts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><stron